IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`

-- P1-annex-i: Annex I of the EU Artificial Intelligence Act (Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 as amended by Regulation (EU) 2026/1744),
-- "List of Union harmonisation legislation": Section A (New Legislative Framework) and Section B (other legislation).
-- THE OMNIBUS CHANGED THIS ANNEX (Regulation (EU) 2026/1744, Article 1 point (41)): point 1 of Section A was deleted and point 21 was
-- added to Section B (a move of the machinery legislation from Section A to Section B, under a new instrument). Both texts are encoded:
-- the entries as enacted (items 1 to 20) and as amended (items 2 to 21), and a dispatcher that reads the version in force on the date asked.
-- The Annex is data that Article 6(1) points at ("the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Annex I"). The listing functions are not
-- gated by Article 113 (fork F-annex-gate): they answer for the text in force on the date asked, and answer NOTHING before the Regulation exists.
-- Article 6(1) is the function that is gated by Chapter III's date. A legislative act that is not on the list is not "listed in Annex I":
-- Article 6(1) hands the class to the list (ruling of 2026-11-05 (a); fork F-annex-i-closed), so it answers JUST FALSE.
-- Section B matters for Article 2(2) (only Article 6(1), 60a and 102 to 112 apply to those products); a seam for the other parts.
-- The text carries the date of adoption and the Official Journal reference of each act; the encoding keeps them as strings, as the Annex has them.

§ `Annex I: the sections, the items and the entries`

