        , `Annex I item 17 entry`
        , `Annex I item 18 entry`
        , `Annex I item 19 entry`
        , `Annex I item 20 entry`

@ref Annex I as amended, items 2 to 21 (src:1677-1698)
`Annex I as amended the entries` MEANS
    LIST
        `Annex I item 2 entry`
        , `Annex I item 3 entry`
        , `Annex I item 4 entry`
        , `Annex I item 5 entry`
        , `Annex I item 6 entry`
        , `Annex I item 7 entry`
        , `Annex I item 8 entry`
        , `Annex I item 9 entry`
        , `Annex I item 10 entry`
        , `Annex I item 11 entry`
        , `Annex I item 12 entry`
        , `Annex I item 13 entry`
        , `Annex I item 14 entry`
        , `Annex I item 15 entry`
        , `Annex I item 16 entry`
        , `Annex I item 17 entry`
        , `Annex I item 18 entry`
        , `Annex I item 19 entry`
        , `Annex I item 20 entry`
        , `Annex I item 21 entry`

§ `Annex I: which entry, in which section, on the date asked`

-- The entry of the item in the text as enacted: NOTHING for an item the text as enacted does not have (item 21, and the case outside the list).
GIVEN `the item` IS AN `Annex I item`
GIVETH A MAYBE `Annex I entry`
`Annex I as enacted the entry of the item` MEANS
    CONSIDER filter (GIVEN e YIELD e's `item number` EQUALS `Annex I the number of the item` `the item`) `Annex I as enacted the entries`
    WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the text as enacted has no such item
    WHEN x FOLLOWED BY rest THEN JUST x

-- The entry of the item in the text as amended: NOTHING for item 1 (deleted by the Omnibus) and the case outside the list.
GIVEN `the item` IS AN `Annex I item`
GIVETH A MAYBE `Annex I entry`
`Annex I as amended the entry of the item` MEANS
    CONSIDER filter (GIVEN e YIELD e's `item number` EQUALS `Annex I the number of the item` `the item`) `Annex I as amended the entries`
    WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the text as amended has no such item (item 1 is deleted)
    WHEN x FOLLOWED BY rest THEN JUST x

-- The dispatcher: the version in force on the date asked decides which table is the Annex.
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the item` IS AN `Annex I item`
GIVETH A MAYBE `Annex I entry`
`Annex I the entry of the item on the date asked` MEANS
    CONSIDER `Omnibus Art 4 the version in force` `the date asked`
    WHEN `as enacted` THEN `Annex I as enacted the entry of the item` `the item`   -- VERSION as enacted
    WHEN `as amended` THEN `Annex I as amended the entry of the item` `the item`   -- VERSION as amended

GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the item` IS AN `Annex I item`
GIVETH A MAYBE `Annex I section`
`Annex I the section of the item on the date asked` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Art 113 the Regulation is in force` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Regulation, and with it the Annex, does not exist before it enters into force
    ELSE CONSIDER `Annex I the entry of the item on the date asked` `the date asked` `the item`
         WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Annex of that date has no such item
         WHEN JUST e THEN JUST (e's `section`)

§ `Annex I: is the legislation that covers the product listed in Annex I, in Section A or in Section B`

-- Item 20 is listed only "in so far as" the product is within the part of Regulation (EU) 2018/1139 the item names (unmanned aircraft and
-- their engines, propellers, parts and equipment to control them remotely). The caller states that fact; every other item ignores it.
-- JUST FALSE: the item is not on the list of that date, or the product is outside the part of item 20 that is listed.
-- NOTHING: the Regulation does not yet exist (the Annex has no date to speak of before it enters into force).
@ref Annex I, Section A
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the item` IS AN `Annex I item`
      `the product is within the part of the legislation that the Annex lists` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Annex I the legislation is listed in Section A` MEANS
    CONSIDER `Annex I the section of the item on the date asked` `the date asked` `the item`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN
        IF `Art 113 the Regulation is in force` `the date asked`
        THEN JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "List of Union harmonisation legislation" (Article 6(1) hands the class to the list; an item not on it, or deleted, is not listed)
        ELSE NOTHING     -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Annex does not exist before the Regulation enters into force
    WHEN JUST `the section` THEN
        JUST (`the section` EQUALS `Annex I Section A`)
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Section B. List of other Union harmonisation legislation" (the item stands in the other section)

@ref Annex I, Section B, item 20 (src:1696)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the item` IS AN `Annex I item`
      `the product is within the part of the legislation that the Annex lists` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Annex I the legislation is listed in Section B` MEANS
    CONSIDER `Annex I the section of the item on the date asked` `the date asked` `the item`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN
        IF `Art 113 the Regulation is in force` `the date asked`
        THEN JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "List of other Union harmonisation legislation" (an item not on the list is not listed)
        ELSE NOTHING     -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Annex does not exist before the Regulation enters into force
    WHEN JUST `the section` THEN
        JUST (    `the section` EQUALS `Annex I Section B`
              AND (    NOT (`the item` EQUALS `Annex I item 20 Regulation (EU) 2018/1139`)
                    OR `the product is within the part of the legislation that the Annex lists`))
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "in so far as the design, production and placing on the market of aircrafts referred to in Article 2(1), points (a) and (b) thereof, where it concerns unmanned aircraft" (item 20 lists only that part)

-- Article 6(1) says "the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Annex I": either section.
@ref Annex I, both sections
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the item` IS AN `Annex I item`
      `the product is within the part of the legislation that the Annex lists` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Annex I the legislation is listed in Annex I` MEANS
    CONSIDER `Annex I the legislation is listed in Section A` `the date asked` `the item` `the product is within the part of the legislation that the Annex lists`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Annex does not exist before the Regulation enters into force
    WHEN JUST `in Section A` THEN
        CONSIDER `Annex I the legislation is listed in Section B` `the date asked` `the item` `the product is within the part of the legislation that the Annex lists`
        WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Annex does not exist before the Regulation enters into force
        WHEN JUST `in Section B` THEN JUST (`in Section A` OR `in Section B`)
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "List of Union harmonisation legislation" (listed in neither section)
